predicted value, right?

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:56.490
So either a zero or, and this indicator function notation counts up the number

00:02:56.490 --> 00:03:00.530
of examples on which, you know, this thing inside is true.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:06.530
So this formula just counts up the number of misclassified examples.

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:10.970
So the problem with this evaluation metric is that it treats pornographic

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:16.650
and non-ponographic images equally, but you really want your classifier to not

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:21.090
mislabel pornographic images, like maybe recognize a pornographic image as a cat

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:25.370
image and therefore show it to an unsuspecting user that's therefore very

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:32.530
