00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:37.610
So one way to change this evaluation metric would be if you add a weight

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:48.850
term here, we call this wi, where wi is going to be equal to 1 if xi is non-porn

00:03:48.850 --> 00:04:02.220
