00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:07.620
So this way you're giving a much larger weight to examples that are pornographic

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:12.460
so that the error term goes up much more if the algorithm makes a mistake on

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:17.630
classifying a pornographic image as a cat image.

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:22.110
And in this example, you're giving a 10 times bigger weight to classifying

